{"h":3106,"lines":[{"x":0.15218127370283188,"y":0.078314509886052264,"w":0.056539707183837912,"t":"Test 1","h":0.014882607837684358,"c":1},{"h":0.015988371407532731,"t":"Questions 27-31","y":0.12645348851498361,"c":1,"x":0.15225563834263706,"w":0.16729323069254559},{"y":0.16419832603033535,"x":0.15225563469936901,"t":"Choose the correct letter, A, B, C or D.","w":0.34774436950683596,"h":0.017487720604949963,"c":1},{"x":0.15225564875528949,"y":0.20057952348557795,"w":0.54511276245117191,"h":0.017443732453866323,"c":1,"t":"Write the correct letter in boxes 27-31 on your answer sheet."},{"h":0.016139992113966883,"c":1,"t":"27 What is the writer suggesting about computer-produced works in the","x":0.15037594128534229,"y":0.2369186043774294,"w":0.6541353352864584},{"c":1,"t":"first paragraph?","h":0.015988372635703185,"w":0.14661654154459636,"x":0.19172932311993246,"y":0.25581395320637323},{"c":1,"x":0.23863549536016668,"t":"People's acceptance of them can vary considerably.","w":0.4644755554199218,"h":0.019691313763856022,"y":0.28170661436900746},{"h":0.013081395234588844,"c":1,"t":"B","x":0.19548872178223117,"y":0.30232558134346144,"w":0.015037593841552732},{"y":0.31976744187871375,"h":0.014534883321060788,"c":1,"t":"C","x":0.19360902296393454,"w":0.016917292277018214},{"y":0.30087209329078834,"x":0.23872180858096159,"w":0.56203008015950517,"c":1,"h":0.017543875626111372,"t":"A great deal of progress has already been attained in this field."},{"w":0.60902257283528649,"t":"They have had more success in some artistic genres than in others.","c":1,"y":0.319703799166978,"x":0.23684209694003311,"h":0.017505503284186652},{"t":"The advances are not as significant as the public believes them to be.","c":1,"h":0.01744186072217524,"x":0.23120300130424254,"y":0.33866279056642812,"w":0.63345865885416663},{"h":0.018895348808647183,"x":0.15037593098674279,"y":0.36627906977861513,"t":"28 According to Geraint Wiggins, why are many people worried by computer art?","c":1,"w":0.73872182210286463},{"y":0.39534883693398515,"t":"A It is aesthetically inferior to human art.","x":0.19360901634312577,"c":1,"h":0.016112850162189329,"w":0.38345865885416663},{"c":1,"y":0.41271748394237229,"t":"It may ultimately supersede human art.","h":0.01837221331083605,"w":0.36478302001953128,"x":0.22362110012239328},{"h":0.015988372635703296,"x":0.22556390843566865,"c":1,"y":0.4316860462362504,"w":0.40601504007975264,"t":"It undermines a fundamental human quality."},{"c":1,"x":0.19548872176880475,"w":0.015037593841552732,"t":"D","h":0.013081395234588844,"y":0.45058139531252295},{"y":0.4479532156572783,"c":1,"t":"It will lead to a deterioration in human ability.","x":0.22736635521776805,"w":0.4099558512369792,"h":0.018684290181569585},{"w":0.60714284261067708,"h":0.017532645235964428,"y":0.47810688977357763,"c":1,"x":0.15037594702202103,"t":"29 What is a key difference between Aaron and the Painting Fool?"},{"w":0.26691729227701821,"t":"its programmer's background","x":0.23496240656825781,"y":0.50579523525442693,"h":0.017460578653172298,"c":1},{"t":"B","x":0.19360902294043825,"y":0.52616279066136018,"c":1,"w":0.016917292277018242,"h":0.013081395234588844},{"t":"C","y":0.54360465111090317,"w":0.015037593841552732,"h":0.013081395234588844,"x":0.19548872178223117,"c":1},{"h":0.013081395234588844,"c":1,"x":0.19548872176880475,"y":0.5624999999636856,"t":"D","w":0.015037593841552732},{"w":0.24672983805338541,"x":0.23099330174958113,"h":0.018965022915498175,"t":"public response to its work","c":1,"y":0.52340071464833227},{"c":1,"t":"the source of its subject matter","y":0.54346426270700798,"x":0.23308270708858325,"w":0.28383458455403643,"h":0.014810045074050149},{"w":0.31390978495279942,"x":0.23496240066327109,"t":"the technical standard of its output","y":0.56245975503608436,"h":0.016097875080489321,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.01744186072217524,"t":"30 What point does Simon Colton make in the fourth paragraph?","x":0.14849623897781555,"y":0.59011627893846941,"w":0.59586466471354171},{"w":0.60157953898111982,"t":"Software-produced art is often dismissed as childish and simplistic.","y":0.61749927057919951,"h":0.017950891911100775,"c":1,"x":0.23680086015403143},{"x":0.19360902294043825,"w":0.016917292277018242,"t":"B","y":0.63808139531252295,"c":1,"h":0.013081395234588733},{"x":0.23684210784149778,"w":0.644736836751302,"y":0.63650998037994788,"t":"The same concepts of creativity should not be applied to all forms of art.","h":0.017707662588538287,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.017533581101809914,"y":0.6540697672821848,"t":"C It is unreasonable to expect a machine to be as imaginative as a human being.","x":0.19360902289540813,"w":0.75},{"x":0.19548872176343418,"y":0.67296511633365563,"w":0.015037593841552732,"t":"D","h":0.014534883321060788,"c":1},{"y":0.67289117827572353,"c":1,"w":0.56203008015950529,"x":0.23308270881122478,"h":0.017515798422573226,"t":"People tend to judge computer art and human art according to"},{"w":0.14714266459147135,"t":"different criteria.","y":0.69046895615162629,"x":0.23848353548472601,"h":0.017502686475371787,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.14849625430801117,"w":0.76127817789713537,"h":0.017483976527482348,"t":"31 The writer refers to the paintings of a chair as an example of computer art which","y":0.7194767444535789},{"w":0.33270675659179688,"y":0.7485465114870945,"x":0.23684211042193487,"c":1,"h":0.017441860722175129,"t":"achieves a particularly striking effect."},{"y":0.76744186042880191,"w":0.016917292277018242,"h":0.013081395234588844,"c":1,"t":"B","x":0.19360902294043825},{"w":0.016917292277018242,"x":0.19360902294043825,"h":0.013081395234588844,"c":1,"t":"C","y":0.78633720926601125},{"h":0.014534883321060788,"x":0.19360902294043825,"y":0.80377906986355585,"w":0.016917292277018242,"c":1,"t":"D"},{"t":"exhibits a certain level of genuine artistic skill.","y":0.76586155510842391,"c":1,"x":0.23676087674344226,"h":0.018577223198688708,"w":0.41179201761881512},{"w":0.40063631693522128,"h":0.019156392742876616,"c":1,"x":0.23672405710602248,"t":"closely resembles that of a well-known artist.","y":0.78361389392138503},{"t":"highlights the technical limitations of the software.","x":0.23684210649741846,"y":0.8037790696347793,"h":0.017534516967655511,"w":0.44736841837565111,"c":1},{"h":0.014534883321060788,"x":0.14849624024460109,"y":0.97674418619054282,"c":1,"w":0.028195489247639954,"t":"26"}],"w":2400}